: 976.86, "end": 979.2, "text": "- You're a sick, sad, twisted old man,"}, {"start": 979.2, "end": 981.1, "text": "and I hope you die alone."}, {"start": 981.1, "end": 981.94, "text": "- Yeah."}, {"start": 984.94, "end": 988.42, "text": "- I wonder what happened in all those other timelines."}, {"start": 992.1, "end": 993.18, "text": "I gotta say, I hope this is the real one,"}, {"start": 993.18, "end": 995.82, "text": "because I just found a nickel in the hallway."}, {"start": 995.82, "end": 998.42, "text": "♪ I said I'm gonna die ♪"}, {"start": 998.42, "end": 1000.26, "text": "(buzzer)"}, {"start": 1000.26, "end": 1001.4, "text": "- Ah, okay."}, {"start": 1001.4, "end": 1003.22, "text": "Starting on my left with one,"}, {"start": 1003.22, "end": 1004.62, "text": "your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 1004.62, "end": 1005.46, "text": "- Just so you know, Jeff,"}, {"start": 1005.46, "end": 1006.74, "text": "you are now creating six different timelines."}, {"start": 1006.74, "end": 1008.6, "text": "- Of course I am, my bad."}, {"start": 1008.6, "end": 1011.36, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 1013.7, "end": 1014.98, "text": "- I don't think you should."}, {"start": 1016.38, "end": 1018.38, "text": "Chaos already dominates enough for our lives."}, {"start": 1018.38, "end": 1021.02, "text": "The universe is an endless raging sea of randomness."}, {"start": 1021.02, "end": 1023.5, "text": "Our job isn't to fight it but to weather it together."}, {"start": 1023.5, "end": 1024.74, "text": "On the raft of life,"}, {"start": 1024.74, "end": 1027.42, "text": "A raft held together by those few rare, beautiful things"}, {"start": 1027.42, "end": 1028.78, "text": "that we know to be predictable."}, {"start": 1028.78, "end": 1032.62, "text": "- Whoops, vines, vines, let him finish."}, {"start": 1032.62, "end": 1035.54, "text": "- Us, it won't matter what happens to us"}, {"start": 1035.54, "end": 1036.76, "text": "as long as we stay honest in accepting"}, {"start": 1036.76, "end": 1038.82, "text": "of each other's flaws and virtues."}, {"start": 1038.82, "end": 1041.22, "text": "Annie will always be driven, surely we'll always be giving."}, {"start": 1041.22, "end": 1042.34, "text": "Pierce will never apologize,"}, {"start": 1042.34, "end": 1043.98, "text": "but it is sort of a wild card from my perspective."}, {"start": 1043.98, "end": 1047.06, "text": "And Jeff will forever remain a conniving son of a bitch."}, {"start": 1047.06, "end": 1047.9, "text": "- Love it."}, {"start": 1047.9, "end": 1050.26, "text": "- There are six sides to this die and seven of us."}, {"start": 1050.26, "end": 1052.62, "text": "He devised a system by which he never has to get the pizza."}, {"start": 1052.62, "end": 1054.02, "text": "- Jeff, really?"}, {"start": 1054.02, "end": 1056.06, "text": "- It's a hefty jackrabbit. - Dig, man."}, {"start": 1056.06, "end": 1057.66, "text": "- Pretty low, dude."}, {"start": 1057.66, "end": 1060.5, "text": "It's called friendship, look it up, and carda it."}, {"start": 1061.62, "end": 1063.66, "text": "- I think we just found our pizza getter."}, {"start": 1063.66, "end": 1065.34, "text": "- Yeah, just eat it. - Yes, just eat it."}, {"start": 1065.34, "end": 1068.04, "text": "- It does. - Oh, like it matters who goes."}, {"start": 1068.04, "end": 1070.06, "text": "(laughing)"}, {"start": 1070.06, "end": 1071.06, "text": "- So funny."}, {"start": 1071.06, "end": 1071.9, "text": "- Karma."}, {"start": 1073.54, "end": 1075.1, "text": "- That guy sucks harder than the toilet"}, {"start": 1075.1, "end": 1076.26, "text": "and an airplane bathroom."}, {"start": 1076.26, "end": 1077.82, "text": "- Airplane bathroom."}, {"start": 1077.82, "end": 1079.74, "text": "- Oh, my pines."}, {"start": 1079.74, "end": 1081.14, "text": "- Rossin!"}, {"start": 1081.14, "end": 1082.46, "text": "- Ooh!"}, {"start": 1082.46, "end": 1085.98, "text": "♪ You don't have to work on the way, right? ♪"}, {"start": 1085.98, "end": 1089.82, "text": "♪ You don't have to stay on the way, right? ♪"}, {"start": 1089.82, "end": 1092.82, "text": "♪ You don't have to stay on the way, right? ♪"}, {"start": 1092.82, "end": 1094.98, "text": "♪ You don't have to stay on the way, right? ♪"}, {"start": 1094.98, "end": 1096.86, "text": "♪ You don't have to work on the way, right? ♪"}, {"start": 1096.86, "end": 1099.38, "text": "♪ You don't have to work on the way, right? ♪"}, {"start": 1099.38, "end": 1101.94, "text": "♪ You don't have to work on the way, right? ♪"}, {"start": 1101.94, "end": 1103.94, "text": "♪ You don't have to work on the way, right? ♪"}, {"start": 1103.94, "end": 1106.14, "text": "♪ You don't have to work on the way, right? ♪"}, {"start": 1106.14, "end": 1107.14, "text": "♪ You don't have to stay on the way, right? ♪"}, {"start": 1107.14, "end": 1108.14, "text": "♪ You don't have to stay on the way, right? ♪"}, {"start": 1108.14, "end": 1109.14, "text": "♪ You don't have to stay on the way, right? ♪"}, {"start": 1109.14, "end": 1112.54, "text": "♪ Rock, sand ♪"}, {"start": 1112.54, "end": 1116.16, "text": "♪ You don't have to put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1116.16, "end": 1119.68, "text": "- You gotta see what happens when I leave you alone, huh?"}, {"start": 1119.68, "end": 1124.18, "text": "♪ You don't have to put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1124.18, "end": 1127.6, "text": "♪ Put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1127.6, "end": 1129.68, "text": "♪ Put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1129.68, "end": 1130.76, "text": "- I'm sure."}, {"start": 1130.76, "end": 1131.6, "text": "♪ Rock, sand ♪"}, {"start": 1131.6, "end": 1134.68, "text": "♪ Put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1134.68, "end": 1137.68, "text": "♪ Put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1139.14, "end": 1142.42, "text": "- Two piers, may he rest in piers?"}, {"start": 1142.42, "end": 1144.52, "text": "(coughing)"}, {"start": 1144.52, "end": 1146.62, "text": "- Shirley, don't you think you've had enough?"}, {"start": 1146.62, "end": 1147.46, "text": "- Of you."}, {"start": 1148.66, "end": 1150.52, "text": "- Guys, I've been thinking about that night over and over."}, {"start": 1150.52, "end": 1151.86, "text": "One thing has become clear."}, {"start": 1151.86, "end": 1153.66, "text": "This is the darkest, most terrible timeline."}, {"start": 1153.66, "end": 1156.66, "text": "- Enough with that timeline, crap, Obed."}, {"start": 1156.66, "end": 1159.04, "text": "Piers got shot in the leg and died."}, {"start": 1159.04, "end": 1161.8, "text": "Shirley's a drunk, and he's locked in a mental ward"}, {"start": 1161.8, "end": 1163.98, "text": "because her guilt drove her insane."}, {"start": 1163.98, "end": 1166.14, "text": "Jeff lost an arm in the fire."}, {"start": 1166.14, "end": 1168.02, "text": "Troy lost his larynx"}, {"start": 1168.02, "end": 1172.92, "text": "because for some dumb reason, he tried to destroy a flaming troll doll by eating it."}, {"start": 1172.92, "end": 1175.78, "text": "- Cleaning it up and saving, about to be true."}, {"start": 1175.78, "end": 1181.82, "text": "- Life has gone to hell, Avid. This is real. Look at us. Look at me."}, {"start": 1181.82, "end": 1186.86, "text": "- Britta, you put one wash away blue streak in your hair, and I lost an arm."}, {"start": 1186.86, "end": 1189.06, "text": "- Exactly. Life got dark."}, {"start": 1189.06, "end": 1190.28, "text": "- Not because Jeff rolled a one."}, {"start": 1190.28, "end": 1192.46, "text": "- Oh, I love how this is my fault somehow."}, {"start": 1192.46, "end": 1194.94, "text": "- It's mine. I've run through that night over and over in my head,"}, {"start": 1194.94, "end": 1196.42, "text": "and I keep coming back to one thought."}, {"start": 1196.42, "end": 1199.02, "text": "\"I should have caught the dye and not let you roll it."}, {"start": 1199.02, "end": 1201.18, "text": "\"I failed to do that and we all suffered for it,"}, {"start": 1201.18, "end": 1202.72, "text": "\"but I'm gonna make it up to you.\""}, {"start": 1205.06, "end": 1205.9, "text": "- What is this?"}, {"start": 1205.9, "end": 1207.66, "text": "- Of all the timelines, this is clearly the darkest,"}, {"start": 1207.66, "end": 1209.7, "text": "which is why I propose we commit to being evil."}, {"start": 1209.7, "end": 1211.14, "text": "I've made us all black OTs out of felt,"}, {"start": 1211.14, "end": 1213.66, "text": "I suggest you put 'em on until you're able to grow your own."}, {"start": 1215.1, "end": 1217.34, "text": "From now on, I'm evil, Abed."}, {"start": 1217.34, "end": 1218.34, "text": "We are the evil study group,"}, {"start": 1218.34, "end": 1220.46, "text": "and we have but one evil goal."}, {"start": 1220.46, "end": 1222.22, "text": "Return somehow to the prime timeline,"}, {"start": 1222.22, "end": 1223.9, "text": "the one that I stopped you from rolling that dye,"}, {"start": 1223.9, "end": 1225.38, "text": "then we destroy the good versions of ourselves"}, {"start": 1225.38, "end": 1226.78, "text": "and reclaim our proper lives."}, {"start": 1228.46, "end": 1229.86, "text": "- Evil Abed."}, {"start": 1229.86, "end": 1232.92, "text": "As Evil Jeff, am I allowed to pull fewer punches with you?"}, {"start": 1232.92, "end": 1233.76, "text": "- Certainly."}, {"start": 1233.76, "end": 1234.9, "text": "- I hate you!"}, {"start": 1234.9, "end": 1236.62, "text": "Shut up with your sci-fi crap!"}, {"start": 1236.62, "end": 1241.06, "text": "I lost my damn arm and you're making fake beards!"}, {"start": 1241.06, "end": 1241.9, "text": "- Go tease."}, {"start": 1248.46, "end": 1251.22, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 1253.38, "end": 1255.78, "text": "Evil, Troy, and Evil, ahh, Bed!"}, {"start": 1263.38, "end": 1264.88, "text": "What's wrong?"}, {"start": 1264.88, "end": 1265.88, "text": "More accurately."}, {"start": 1265.88, "end": 1266.88, "text": "I don't know."}, {"start": 1266.88, "end": 1268.88, "text": "We got out just in space."}, {"start": 1268.88, "end": 1271.38, "text": "Well, I certainly want to write it, but I'm a good knight."}, {"start": 1271.38, "end": 1272.38, "text": "I guess not, then."}]}